lingmo-sdk (5.1.3+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Complete Liquid Glass coverage across all interactive SDK controls:
    - SidebarItem: shadow+rim on selected/pressed state pill.
    - RoundImageButton: shadow+rim when hover/press plate is visible.
    - WindowTabBar Tab: shadow+rim on the selected (raised) tab pill.
    - WindowTabBar CloseButton: shadow-only on hover (16×16, no rim needed).
    - Switch: remove broken thumb specular (radius > height caused white rect);
      keep handle drop shadow only; add hover track brightness tween.
    - SegmentedControl: add hover highlight on non-current segments.
    - SearchField: add drop shadow.
    - DialogButton: add drop shadow.
    - toolkit_colors.cpp: fix Liquid Glass light-mode button/ComboBox/Checkbox
      backgrounds from kWhite.withAlpha(0.60) to kBlack.withAlpha(0.07) so
      controls are visible on white/near-white window backgrounds.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Wed, 26 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0800

